-- and the hazard of what is present after the forms have had time to interconvert: the worst hazard in the
-- interconversion class, because what is administered becomes both. The rate decides whether the class is
-- one form or two, exactly as it decides a signal count: this is ic-within applied to a hazard instead of
-- a spectrum.
class-hazard : Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat
class-hazard f inv-rate window = case leb inv-rate window of
  true → 1
  false → form-hazard f
